WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.101 --> 00:00:04.976
Crust, mantle, outer core and inner core: hotter and higher pressure with depth.

2
00:00:05.777 --> 00:00:09.002
A wedge of the Earth, from the crust to the centre.

3
00:00:12.161 --> 00:00:16.311
About three thousand kilometres down: the liquid outer core.

4
00:00:18.229 --> 00:00:22.854
At the centre, the inner core is solid: hottest, and under the most pressure.
